  "statement_html": "Cliquez sur les bonnes réponses.\t<div class=\"wims_instruction\">Une seule bonne réponse par question.</div>\t<table class=\"wimscenter wimsborder\">\t<tr><th>QUESTIONS</th><th>A</th>\t<th>B</th><th>C</th>\t<th>D</th></tr>\t<tr><td>Quand on double le rayon d'une boule, son volume est multiplié par :</td>\t <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply1\" data-pos=\"1\">6</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply1\" data-pos=\"2\">4</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply1\" data-pos=\"3\">8</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply1\" data-pos=\"4\">2</span></td> </tr>\t<tr><td>Une vitesse égale à \\(\\large 36 km.h^{-1}\\) correspond à :</td>\t <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply2\" data-pos=\"1\">\\(\\large 360 m.s^{-1}\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply2\" data-pos=\"2\">\\(\\large 100 m.s^{-1}\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply2\" data-pos=\"3\">\\(\\large 10 m.s^{-1}\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply2\" data-pos=\"4\">\\(\\large 60 m.s^{-1}\\)</span></td> </tr>\t<tr><td>Quand on divise \\(\\sqrt{525}\\) par 5, on obtient :</td>\t <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply3\" data-pos=\"1\">\\(\\large 5 \\sqrt{21}\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply3\" data-pos=\"2\">\\(\\large \\sqrt{105}\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply3\" data-pos=\"3\">\\(\\large \\sqrt{21}\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply3\" data-pos=\"4\">\\(\\large 21 \\sqrt{5}\\)</span></td> </tr>\t<tr><td>On donne : 1 To &#40; téraoctet &#41; = \\(10^{12}\\) octets et 1 Go &#40; gigaoctet &#41; = \\(10^{9}\\) octets. On partage un disque dur de 1,5 To en dossiers de 60 Go chacun. Le nombre de dossiers obtenus est égal à :</td>\t <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply4\" data-pos=\"1\">\\(\\large 1000\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply4\" data-pos=\"2\">\\(\\large 4 \\times 10^{22}\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply4\" data-pos=\"3\">\\(\\large 25\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply4\" data-pos=\"4\">\\(\\large 2,5 \\times 10^{19}\\)</span></td> </tr>\t<tr><td>Le PGCD des nombres 84 et 133 est ...</td>\t <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply5\" data-pos=\"1\">3</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply5\" data-pos=\"2\">7</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply5\" data-pos=\"3\">84</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply5\" data-pos=\"4\">1</span></td> </tr>\t</table>",
